  <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-4">
    <p>Plenty of great watchfaces don't show the date. Big Date is meant to be assigned to a Quick Launch button, so the date is one press away no matter which face you're using. It quits on its own to match the backlight timeout, and has an AppGlance for the launcher.</p>
    <p>It supports every Pebble, including the new Pebble Time 2 and Round 2.</p>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Install it from the <a href="https://apps.rebble.io/en_US/application/69cbf53974b3f700092fd631" class="flutter arrow-external">Rebble store</a>, or check out the source on <a href="https://github.com/CobreDev/big-date" class="flutter arrow-external">GitHub</a>.</p>
